Mr. Wilder gave Shadow Agent's [[Amulet]] to [[Unnamed Suit 054]], with [[Unnamed Suit 057|Suit 057]] being given [[Doom Warden]], as reserve power. After being invoked in battle, Shadow Agent fought [[Sabriel|Powerbonded Sabriel]] but was defeated by a [[Cherit|charged-up]] [[Vigilante]] after a failed attempt by the Suits to capture [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{Source|Gremlow Infestation!}}

Shadow Agent was summoned by the same Suit in the battle for the [[Ring]] of [[Umbra]] in the vault of [[Hernán Cortés]]. After a standoff with [[Kaioh the Tracker]], he was held in shock by [[Enfluxion]] and then was defeated with a [[Raypulse]] cast by [[Lok Lambert]]. {{Source|The Power of Umbra}}

Another Shadow Agent came smashing through the window of [[Dante Vale's house]] clutching [[Emi]], a [[Seeker]] who he had been pursuing. Dante used [[Slipsnare]] to restrict him while Lok hit him with a [[Touchram]], defeating him. Later, when the Huntik team arrived at Emi's house, Mr. Wilder's Suits showed up with two Shadow Agent Titans. In the ensuing fight, they were defeated by [[Baselaird|Powerbonded Baselaird]] and [[Vigilante|Powerbonded Vigilante]]. Later, in the underwater ruins of Yonaguni, another Shadow Agent was invoked alongside [[Hoffman]]'s [[Myrmidon]]. It was defeated by  [[Pendragon|Powerbonded Pendragon]].  {{source|The Guardian of Yonaguni}}
